      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eddyville%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Eddyville is close to two protected wilderness areas: Burden Falls Wilderness and Lusk Creek Wilderness, offering hikers quiet natural trails.",
